In_the_wild,_Cronies_and_Crazies_are_on_the_same_level_of_the_food_chain._An_almost_symbiotic_relationship_exists_between_the_two_in_some_ecosystems._For_example,_the_Cronie_will_eat_the_slime_off_of_the_Crazies'_backs_for_nutrients,_thus_enabling_the_Crazies_to_see_out_their_third_eye_located_on_their_backs_to_watch_for_predators_such_as_Fangies._END
